{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/en/ep5/quest_story/15110090.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15110090","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15110090","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1511009001:0":{"text":"The Wedge of Power... think we'll see divine authority in action?","source_cn":"权能之楔……莫非会和神权有关？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C668D265B3C7826","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1511009002:0":{"text":"Ah... if only I had a chance to witness a divine battle...","source_cn":"啊，要是有机会目睹一场诸神混战该有多好啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x187524240E395518","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511009003:0":{"text":"That sounds like a disaster waiting to happen.","source_cn":"那会带来灾难。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6055B99DE805A564","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511009004:0":{"text":"Though the sealing wedges were placed by the gods, they don't hold the gods' powers themselves. They're closer to the core elements that shape the world.","source_cn":"封印之楔虽为诸神所设，但它不会承载诸神的权能，更趋近于...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x469639DBA2C46644","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511009005:0":{"text":"We'll be confronting unrestrained power. Be prepared.","source_cn":"我们将要面对象征权能本身的力量。做好准备吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF39387BFE50783B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:摩根":{"text":"Morgan","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:加拉":{"text":"Gala","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"Merlin the First","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/en/ep5/quest_story/15201100.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15201100","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15201100","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:1:1520110001:1":{"text":"Merlin the First envelops you with her magic, teleporting you to the realm of the Wedge of Power.","source_cn":"初代梅林的魔力包围了你们，将你们传送到权能之楔的领域","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ACA03FA64499EC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":0}},"locales/en/ep5/quest_story/15201120.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15201120","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15201120","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1520112001:0":{"text":"Wow, I didn't know we could get this close.","source_cn":"居然传送到了离权能之楔这么近的地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06348960703B519C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1520112002:0":{"text":"Good, this saves us a lot of trouble.","source_cn":"也好，这样省了不少麻烦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x176293AB6F7331EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520112003:0":{"text":"Let's get closer and see if we can find a way to lift the seal.","source_cn":"上前看看，找机会解除它的封印。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34E34DE0EC600D3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:摩根":{"text":"Morgan","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"Merlin the First","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/en/ep5/quest_story/15201170.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15201170","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15201170","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1520117001:0":{"text":"We've been moved. What's the deal with this Wedge of Power?","source_cn":"我们换位置了，这个权能之楔是怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC3492B43D4AEC8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1520117002:0":{"text":"Power is the <style=\"highlight\">lord of the winds</style>.","source_cn":"权能——意味着<style=highlight>风的力...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12185DE883BBDC49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520117003:0":{"text":"The gale carried us to the real starting point. Our challenge begins here.","source_cn":"它用狂风将我们送到了真正的起点。挑战将从这里开始。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5BC3527C34D2329","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1520117003":{"text":"The gale carried us to the real starting point. Our challenge begins here.","source_cn":"它用狂风将我们送到了真正的起点。挑战将从这里开始。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5BC3527C34D2329","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520117004:1":{"text":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, there's a dock on this island.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2B27F5BE72655FB0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, there's a dock on this island.","female":"Master <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, there's a dock on this island.","variant_male_record_index":"177340","variant_female_record_index":"177341","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520117005:0":{"text":"Ah, I see! Looks like we'll have to <style=\"highlight\">go by water</style> to reach the wedge.","source_cn":"看来，想要靠近它，必须要<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB5CFDAEB0F07B6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520117006:0":{"text":"Come on, let's take the boat. Fingers crossed there won't be any more fierce winds!","source_cn":"走吧，我们乘船试试。但愿水上不要有狂风。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18037F135D9E6DCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"But I see no path nearby.","source_cn":"但附近没有路","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFED1EC0DB71BB58F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"But I see no path nearby.","female":"But I see no path nearby.","variant_male_record_index":"75752","variant_female_record_index":"75753","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"It's all water around us.","source_cn":"这周围都是水域","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x10D1BBB1C8A60D1A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's all water around us.","female":"It's all water around us.","variant_male_record_index":"75754","variant_female_record_index":"75755","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:摩根":{"text":"Morgan","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"Merlin the First","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:加拉":{"text":"Gala","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/en/ep5/quest_story/15201180.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15201180","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15201180","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1520118001:0":{"text":"Hop on! Don't count on me to row, though.","source_cn":"上船吧，不过别指望我来划船。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD27F0BBA8511BE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:摩根":{"text":"Morgan","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/ep5/quest_story/15201190.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15201190","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15201190","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1520119001:0":{"text":"I've scoped it out. If we go from here, the wedge won't notice us.","source_cn":"我观察过了，从这个方向靠近，权能之楔无法发现我们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x786B5AE847984F74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520119002:0":{"text":"As long as we avoid the winds, the wedge won't stand a chance against us.","source_cn":"只要避开它的狂风，它就不是我们的对手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6F80EC43AA39146","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520119003:0":{"text":"Let's strike while the iron's hot.","source_cn":"抓紧时间，速战速决。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADF3DBDF5E9D67A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:摩根":{"text":"Morgan","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"Merlin the First","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/en/ep5/quest_story/15201200.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15201200","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15201200","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1520120001:0":{"text":"The chain representing the Wedge of Power is gone.","source_cn":"权能之楔对应的锁链已经消散。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x416816ACFEF6DC3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"Merlin the First","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/en/timeline/quest_story/15201150.json":{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15201150","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15201150","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:2:1520115001:0":{"text":"A gust of blustery wind hits you.","source_cn":"一阵狂风袭向你们","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C2CA3C6A0D46243","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1520115002:0":{"text":"When the wind dies down, you realize you're no longer in the same spot.","source_cn":"风停后，你发现自己已经不在原来的地方","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A5D9A38B2235B78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":0}},"locales/en/timeline/timeline_story/1501011001.json":{"asset_key":"timeline